目标：portable / 功能块：FanHysteresis

流程：完整 ST → 固定扫描检查 → 独立反例审查 → 带验证记录的交付包。

## 接口

- inputs: enabled: BOOL
- inputs: temperature: REAL
- outputs: fan: BOOL

## 需求及检查

- R1: Fan state starts FALSE: the first scan of a fresh FB with temperature strictly inside the band never reports fan=TRUE.；场景：fresh_fb_starts_off
- R2: On every scan with enabled=FALSE the output fan is FALSE, regardless of temperature and of the previous fan state.；场景：fresh_fb_starts_off, disabled_overrides_hot_temperature
- R3: With enabled=TRUE, temperature >= 30.0 (30.0 inclusive) sets fan=TRUE.；场景：enable_at_upper_threshold_then_retain, band_retains_false_until_30, reenable_in_band_stays_off, full_cycle_boundaries
- R4: With enabled=TRUE, temperature <= 25.0 (25.0 inclusive) sets fan=FALSE.；场景：enable_at_upper_threshold_then_retain, full_cycle_boundaries
- R5: With enabled=TRUE and 25.0 < temperature < 30.0 the previous fan state is retained unchanged.；场景：enable_at_upper_threshold_then_retain, band_retains_false_until_30
- R6: After enabled=FALSE (which forces fan=FALSE) and enabled=TRUE again inside the band 25.0 < temperature < 30.0, fan remains FALSE until temperature reaches 30.0; the pre-disable TRUE state is not restored.；场景：reenable_in_band_stays_off

## 扫描约定

Fresh FB per scenario; all inputs assigned each scan; outputs observed after invocation. Times and TIME/LTIME interface values are milliseconds. First eligible TON invocation has elapsed=0. No real-time/hardware claim.

## 假设

- Sampling: fresh FB instance per scenario; inputs are assigned before every invocation and outputs are observed after the invocation; time_ms is a bookkeeping marker (10 ms per scan) with no real-time claim.
- The FB is invoked once per scan by a cyclic program; only post-invocation outputs are observed.
- The temperature input is always a finite REAL value; NaN/Inf behaviour is out of scope, so no special handling is required or tested.
- No state is kept outside the FB instance: disabling does not memorise the earlier fan=TRUE state.
- Exactly 30.0 is treated as '>= 30.0' and exactly 25.0 as '<= 25.0'; no rounding logic is expected.
- No timing, hardware access or safety-rated behaviour is claimed; target portable is an offline reference execution, not a CODESYS compile.

## 待回答问题


